# panel-card-frontier 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel
# (Class F card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc frontier.
# Original in-house art, generated deterministically by
# w10c-rig/gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the arc record: "Trial
# Grounds — CONQUERED." / "Seven Symbols at the Gold standard,
# and a rematch years in the making finally won. The Frontier
# salutes you." Dawn over the island of arenas: the rising
# sun throws a fan of rays — the salute — and the SEVEN Gold
# Symbols hang in an arc above the facility roofs.
PIX panel-card-frontier 128 80
